Z||000019||TheFiero64||02-17-2001||11:49 AM||||The only reason I like the 577 over the 113 is the fact that you can stand up in the back. lots of room to work on the colder days. I bet the 113's are a lot better because of less weight and lower center of gravity. Not to mention the huge blind spot on the 577 because of the generator mount, almost impossible to drive around without your TCer communicating with you. <P>Here are some pics I dug up online of M-577's.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://military.railfan.net/mv/m577.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://military.railfan.net/mv/m577_2.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>88 Coupe V6<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||1
